sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SRC as Source<br/>(GSTSAAS / IRP)
    participant API as API Gateway<br/>(+WAF, Cognito)
    participant ING as Ingestion Lambda
    participant DDB as DynamoDB<br/>(source_hash)
    participant S3 as S3 vault
    participant AUR as Aurora ledger<br/>(SoR)
    participant EVB as EventBridge
    participant CMP as Compliance Lambdas<br/>(GST/TDS/ROC)
    participant GSTN as GSTN / IRP
    participant REC as Reconciliation
    participant DASH as FY dashboard

    Note over SRC,AUR: 1 — Capture a sales invoice (idempotent, validated, posted)
    SRC->>API: POST sales_invoice.contract.json
    API->>ING: authorized + schema-valid payload
    ING->>DDB: seen source_hash?
    DDB-->>ING: new
    ING->>S3: store source document (FY-partitioned)
    ING->>AUR: draft journal (Dr Debtor / Cr Sales / Cr Output GST)
    ING->>AUR: post → balance check + immutability enforced
    AUR-->>EVB: JournalPosted event

    Note over EVB,GSTN: 2 — Compliance derives from the ledger (period-end)
    EVB->>CMP: refresh GSTR-1 / ITC staging
    CMP->>AUR: read posted vouchers (co_v_gstr1_feed)
    CMP->>GSTN: e-invoice IRN (real-time) / GSTR-1 JSON (period)
    GSTN-->>CMP: IRN + signed QR / filing ack
    CMP->>AUR: write versioned return (co_gstr1, co_gstr3b_summary)

    Note over REC,DASH: 3 — Reconcile internal vs CA/Tally, then publish
    REC->>AUR: internal figures (trial balance, output tax, ITC)
    REC->>REC: compare vs Tally export + GSTR-2B (10 control points)
    REC->>AUR: write variances (co_recon_variance, RAG)
    AUR-->>EVB: FinancialFactsPublished (turnover, ITC, runway)
    EVB->>DASH: FY financials + reconciliation matrix
    Note right of DASH: Same facts also fan out to<br/>Eka Brain (finance_lora) + other products
